  "instructions": [
    "1. Say to your AI: \"Run tool:lay-out-a-profile\", and give it layout, sources.",
    "2. The AI calls run_resource_operation at @workshop-tools with method tools:run, tool tool:lay-out-a-profile and its input (the worked example shows one).",
